  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "Busan's fireworks night is a bridge show,",
      "startFrame": 12,
      "endFrame": 65
    },
    {
      "text": "and that's not a figure of speech.",
      "startFrame": 66,
      "endFrame": 105
    },
    {
      "text": "The Gwangan Bridge isn't the backdrop.",
      "startFrame": 106,
      "endFrame": 154
    },
    {
      "text": "The deck itself is the launch platform,",
      "startFrame": 155,
      "endFrame": 205
    },
    {
      "text": "and the cascades fall",
      "startFrame": 206,
      "endFrame": 235
    },
    {
      "text": "from the span into the water.",
      "startFrame": 236,
      "endFrame": 279
    },
    {
      "text": "Seventh of November.",
      "startFrame": 280,
      "endFrame": 321
    },
    {
      "text": "Which makes it the hardest ticket in Busan.",
      "startFrame": 328,
      "endFrame": 394
    },
    {
      "text": "Last year fourteen thousand seats went on sale,",
      "startFrame": 395,
      "endFrame": 466
    },
    {
      "text": "and the early-bird block sold out in one minute.",
      "startFrame": 467,
      "endFrame": 533
    },
    {
      "text": "For 2026 nothing has been published yet,",
      "startFrame": 534,
      "endFrame": 604
    },
    {
      "text": "and if it follows last year,",
      "startFrame": 605,
      "endFrame": 640
    },
    {
      "text": "that window is late August.",
      "startFrame": 641,
      "endFrame": 694
    },
    {
      "text": "On the day the bridge closes completely.",
      "startFrame": 701,
      "endFrame": 747
    },
    {
      "text": "They are setting off explosives from a motorway.",
      "startFrame": 748,
      "endFrame": 812
    },
    {
      "text": "Trains can run straight through",
      "startFrame": 813,
      "endFrame": 844
    },
    {
      "text": "the beach stations without stopping.",
      "startFrame": 845,
      "endFrame": 891
    },
    {
      "text": "But almost everyone there watches for free,",
      "startFrame": 892,
      "endFrame": 946
    },
    {
      "text": "from sand facing exactly the same bridge.",
      "startFrame": 947,
      "endFrame": 1014
    },
    {
      "text": "Plan it before you land,",
      "startFrame": 1015,
      "endFrame": 1043
    },
    {
      "text": "at epickor.com.",
      "startFrame": 1044,
      "endFrame": 1083
    }
  ],
